The attribution must include, where technically and reasonably possible, a reference to the original AgentGuard repository:

https://github.com/chrismsmr-celcom/agentguard

You may not falsely represent yourself as the original author or creator of AgentGuard.

You may not remove, obscure, alter, or falsify existing copyright, authorship, license, or attribution notices.

